=== M.A.R.I.L.L.A. ===
{{Expand section}}Narrator and [[M.A.R.I.L.L.A.]] have a very contentious relationship, often berating each other, calling them names, and making cynical remarks about how little their lives matter. In spite of this, they continue working with each other on several business ventures for years on end. At the same time, they do not appear to know each other particularly well, Narrator believing that M.A.R.I.L.L.A. "was created a few thousand years before rocks were invented."<ref>{{ytl|Z4haZTbU9ZA|The Secrets of Minecraft's Deep Dark @ 0:54|Minecraft|June 24, 2022|t=67s}}</ref>

=== Mobbo ===
{{Expand section}}
Narrator appears to have a complicated relationship with [[Mobbo]]. While referring to him as an abomination on many occasions, he was shown to be willing to marry him, and was disheartened to know they weren't together.<ref name=":interview" />

