== Trivia ==
* The description card on ''Minecraft''<nowiki/>'s YouTube channel has him as "Untelligent",<sup>{{Sic}}</sup> "Self-proclaimed ''Minecraft'' expert", etc. This changes each episode.
* Narrator allegedly married [[Mobbo]], though he doesn't remember it.<ref>{{ytl|zj7oviDVEh4|Ending Minecraft: How We Make Minecraft Episode 9 @ 6:56|Minecraft|Apr 30, 2021|t=416s}}</ref><ref>{{ytl|Z4haZTbU9ZA|The Secrets of Minecraft's Deep Dark @ 2:12|Minecraft|June 24, 2022|t=132s}}</ref>
* He claims to have been born with the first name of "[[Villager|Testificates]]," because his parents didn't like him.{{Cn}} If Narrator is his family name, (which it has been alluded to) that would put his full name as "Testificates Narrator."
** This is contradicted in a [[The Untold Mystery of Minecraft|later video]], where he suspects his name is "ARGHH-HOT-HOT-HOT-LAND."<ref name=":mystery">{{YouTube link|NTcco6ympRk|THE UNTOLD MYSTERY OF MINECRAFT|Minecraft|August 31, 2025}}</ref>
* Narrator apparently built him and Jonathan's house, but when Jonathan got it in the divorce, it was actually just a decoy.{{Cn}}
*He claims to have been almost cast in ''{{w|Avengers: Endgame}}'', playing a character M.A.R.I.L.L.A. refers to as “Cowardly British Man.”<ref name=":interview">{{Mcnet|new-show-alert--the-secrets-minecraft|New show alert: The Secrets of Minecraft|July 26, 2021|[[Tom Stone]]}}</ref>
**He also claims to have been offered the lead role in ''{{w|Iron Man 2}}'', which he didn't take because of the [[Minecraft]] voiceover opportunity.{{Cn}}
*Narrator is a fan of "late 90s gangster rap," so much that it's apparently a sore spot for his neighbors.<ref>{{YouTube link|PiGKxxvCkUw|The Scariest Cow Ever Created ┃The Story Of The Warden|Minecraft|March 30, 2024}}</ref>
*Narrator's house lacks a roof, for reasons he's not even aware of.<ref name=":mystery" />
*When Narrator was hired by Mojang, he was given various stipulations. This includes overtime calls from [[Jens Bergensten]] as early as 3AM, improvised requests such as "[narrating] him going to get a glass of water," flying to {{Wikipedia|Sweden}} to make repairs to the Mojang headquarters, selling the rights to Mobbo, and losing his salary if he ever gets trapped inside the video game.<ref name=":survival" />
**The latter scenario went on to happen at least twice in the series.
*He claims to have "invented {{Wikipedia|wasp}} stings and despair."<ref>{{YouTube link|6DDwo8TulM0|ADDING A NEW ITEM {{!}} HOW WE MAKE MINECRAFT|Minecraft|August 31, 2024}}</ref>
*As of ''[[The Sounds of Minecraft]]'', Narrator claims to be 112 years old. However, in [[Survival (video)|Survival]], he said that he had been trapped in the game for longer than he had been alive. Given [[Minecraft Time]] operates quicker than real time, this would mean he spent at least 817,600 minutes in the game, or approximately 19 months.
*In [[How We're Making the Warden]], when Narrator was talking about the prototypes of the [[sculk]], [[M.A.R.I.L.L.A.]] mentioned that {{w|trypophobia}} was one of his fears.

